It reads the SYR leak protection devices of the user's own local network
through their local JSON API (port 5333). This integration is not affiliated
with nor endorsed by Hans Sasserath GmbH & Co. KG (SYR), Hansgrohe, Reliance
Worldwide or the other brands of the same devices; SYR, SafeTech, Pontos and
the other names are trademarks of their owners.

The paths, fields, value formats and alarm codes of the local API follow the
community documentation of alexhass/syr_connect
(https://github.com/alexhass/syr_connect, Apache-2.0: docs/syrconnect-protocol.md,
docs/known_issues_json_api.md and its device captures) and of
ahornung/syr-safetech-connect-api
(https://github.com/ahornung/syr-safetech-connect-api, MIT), read for the facts
only: no code is taken from them.
